{"id":"vod_sn_36433","vodId":"36433","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"足球小将1983","name_cn":"足球小将1983","date":"1983-01-01","year":"1983","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/803fd1cab725df0c7f6f470db2820340.jpg"},"summary":"某一天，平静祥和的南葛市迎来了一名新的成员，他叫大空翼，是一个热爱足球的小学生。身为船长的父亲常年出海，足球就是他最好的玩伴。在此他结识石崎、大姐头等真诚的玩伴，也遇到了球场上最初的对手若林源三。随着大空翼的加入，往常在球场上名不见经传的南葛小学开始崭露头角，最终得以进入全日本少年足球大赛。在这里，大空翼遇到了无数强劲的对手，三杉淳、立花兄弟、若岛津健、日向小次郎。他们不仅是技战术精湛的强悍敌手，更是大空翼日后率领日本队征战全世界时最亲密的伙伴。少年们在烈日下尽情挥洒喜悦的汗水……　　本片根据高桥阳一同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":134,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cRnctwf7yZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z3hF20V1RZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sC63fTtbY81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WpMp9DRuMb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h1TVCw9UgH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zs2aX1VAzX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wynh5K2P6D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Mn7EEM2nhF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ykHdYcZ6rb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qEvmdhkGX91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mpug5XMK961/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vBbVQ9crsF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SXsaUBHxan1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u3eEiXrh801/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.